{"path":"index.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
  <title>{{BUSINESS_NAME}} — Sound Baths & Sensory Events</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Premium sound baths in {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}. Restorative group events and private sessions guided by {{FACILITATOR_NAME}}.">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="assets/css/styles.css">
  <script defer src="assets/js/main.js"></script>
</head>
<body class="lux-gallery">
  <header class="site-header">
    <div class="brand">
      <svg class="logo" viewBox="0 0 120 24" aria-hidden="true"><defs><linearGradient id="g1" x1="0" x2="1"><stop offset="0" stop-color="#8bd3d6"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#6b5bff"/></linearGradient></defs><text x="0" y="16" fill="url(#g1)" font-family="Verdana, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="14">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</text></svg>
      <p class="tag">{{TAGLINE}}</p>
    </div>
    <nav class="nav">
      <button class="nav-toggle" aria-label="Open menu">☰</button>
      <ul class="nav-list">
        <li><a href="events.html">Gatherings</a></li>
        <li><a href="private-sessions.html">Private</a></li>
        <li><a href="pricing.html">Rates</a></li>
        <li><a href="about.html">Our Story</a></li>
        <li><a href="faq.html">Answers</a></li>
        <li><a class="cta" href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a></li>
        <li><a href="contact.html">Contact</a></li>
      </ul>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <main>
    <section id="hero" class="hero" aria-label="hero">
      <div class="hero-inner pattern-bg">
        <h1 class="hero-title">Resonant Rest · Curated Sound Baths in {{CITY}}</h1>
        <p class="hero-lead">A clinical-calm approach to immersive sound, blending intention, safety, and exquisite acoustics.</p>
        <div class="hero-actions">
          <a class="btn btn-primary" href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>
          <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="events.html">Next Event: {{NEXT_EVENT_DATE}}</a>
        </div>
        <p class="hero-meta">Facilitated by {{FACILITATOR_NAME}} · Venue: {{VENUE_NAME}}</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="myth_vs_truth" class="myth-truth">
      <div class="container">
        <h2>Myths vs. Measured Truths</h2>
        <div class="grid">
          <div class="card">
            <h3>Myth: "Sound baths are mystical only"</h3>
            <p>Truth: We frame sessions with intention, sensory cues, and research-informed pacing — not mysticism.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="card">
            <h3>Myth: "You must "empty" your mind"</h3>
            <p>Truth: We guide attention and breathing patterns; the practice is gentle redirection rather than forced clearing.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="card">
            <h3>Myth: "Any sound is fine"</h3>
            <p>Truth: Instrument timbre, frequency blends and silence are curated to support nervous system stabilization.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="pillars" class="pillars">
      <div class="container">
        <h2>Core Pillars of a Session</h2>
        <div class="pills">
          <article>
            <h4>Sensation</h4>
            <p>Deliberate textures — crystal bowls, a Himalayan chime, and the deep wash of a gong — create layered experience for the body to register and release.</p>
          </article>
          <article>
            <h4>Structure</h4>
            <p>Begin with orientation, then a guided breath and gentle sound introduction; a 30–45 minute immersion follows, closing with integration and journaling prompts.</p>
          </article>
          <article>
            <h4>Safety</h4>
            <p>We screen for contraindications, offer ear protection, and maintain a calming, supervised environment for all participants.</p>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="case_notes" class="case-notes">
      <div class="container">
        <h2>Clinical Notes & Case Summaries</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>
            <strong>Session #12 — Group Restorative:</strong> Noted reductions in subjective stress scores; participants reported deeper diaphragmatic breathing post‑session.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>1:1 Integration — Trauma-Informed:</strong> Slower introduction of low-frequency energy helped minimize overstimulation while promoting vagal tone.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Corporate Offsite:</strong> A 45‑minute sound arc with tuning forks and monochord supported team recalibration and focused reflection.
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="faq" class="faq">
      <div class="container">
        <h2>Frequently Asked — Sensory & Safety</h2>
        <div class="faq-grid">
          <div>
            <h3>What should I bring?</h3>
            <p>Bring a comfortable mat or yoga pad, a cozy blanket, a small pillow for neck support, and an eye cover. We provide mats on request.</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3>Are there contraindications?</h3>
            <p>People with recent head injuries, uncontrolled seizures, implanted medical devices sensitive to vibration, pregnancy in the first trimester, or active psychosis should consult their clinician first. If you use medications that affect consciousness, inform the facilitator. This is not a substitute for medical care.</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3>Session flow — what to expect</h3>
            <p>Arrival & check-in (10–15 min), orientation & breathwork (5–10 min), sound immersion (30–45 min), slow reorientation and optional sharing (10–15 min). Total time usually 70–90 minutes.</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3>Can I nap during the sound bath?</h3>
            <p>Yes. Many participants rest or sleep; the experience is self‑paced and safe, with staff present to assist.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="cta" class="cta-band">
      <div class="container">
        <h2>Ready to reserve your place?</h2>
        <p>Book a seat at our next gathering or schedule a private session tailored to your needs.</p>
        <div class="actions">
          <a class="btn btn-primary" href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>
          <a class="link" href="book.html">Reserve or Ask Questions</a>
        </div>
        <p class="contact">Call <a href="tel:{{PHONE}}">{{PHONE}}</a> or email <a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}">{{EMAIL}}</a></p>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer class="site-footer">
    <div class="container">
      <p>&copy; <span id="year"></span> {{BUSINESS_NAME}} · {{VENUE_NAME}} · {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</p>
      <p>Facilitator: {{FACILITATOR_NAME}} · <a href="events.html">Upcoming: {{NEXT_EVENT_DATE}}</a></p>
    </div>
  </footer>
</body>
</html>"} 
